config BR2_PACKAGE_SINTY_POWERD
	bool "sinty-powerd"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_GO_TARGET_ARCH_SUPPORTS
	help
	  The power daemon of SintyOS: batteries and power supplies on
	  org.freedesktop.UPower, the power profiles of
	  power-profiles-daemon and a thermal guard, in one process.
	  Replaces the UPower daemon, power-profiles-daemon and
	  thermald; libupower-glib stays for its clients.

	  https://github.com/singularityos-lab/sinty-powerd
